  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UK-CGIAR Centre Research Projects via CABI 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will facilitate FCDO funding to UK-based research projects in the UK-CGIAR Centre via our secretariat partner, CABI. The UK-CGIAR Science Collaboration Centre will showcase UK science strengths and catalyse international partnerships through, exploiting CGIAR&#x2019;s global presence and science capabilities and fast-tracking UK science through to impact. The centre will deliver two objectives aligned with the IDS and ITS: 1) It will embed UK science into science leadership positions within the CGUAR research programmes, leveraging emerging technology and fast-tracking UK R&amp;D into use through CGIAR programmes.2) It will exploit CGIAR presence and partnerships in priority regions to develop new programming.</narrative>
  </description>
